#: ../../openmvcam/shields/touch-lcd-shield.rst:77
msgid ""
"Drive the backlight via PWM for adjustable brightness. Wrap "
":class:`machine.PWM` in a small backlight controller class and pass it to "
":class:`~display.SPIDisplay` through its ``backlight`` argument — "
":class:`~display.SPIDisplay` calls ``backlight(value)`` on the object "
"whenever it needs to update the level::"
